From: mscharged-port contributors
Subject: [PATCH] Select original frontend image packets and share image raster state
Upstream-base: 2c5c51e483b652d178ef06a44b83b07a0f97d2a6

Select original textured glQuad3 packet construction and colour assignment.
Native callers retain checked real texture ownership and submit through GLView
without the console enum/pointer conversion. Untextured fallback and unrelated
quad utilities remain unselected. Share unchanged FERender image raster setup;
movie/grab service readiness is not supplied.

